    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26">

                <pb facs="0031" n="19" xml:id="pg19"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760D.62/87: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-08T21:00:00+03:00">April 8, 1941—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>710. A person whom I regard as reliable has informed me that a very large number
                    of Germans in civilian clothes have recently arrived in Finland from
                    Germany.</p>
                <p>My informant also stated that the Finnish Government recently intimated to the
                    German Government its desire to become a signatory to the Tripartite Pact and
                    has been advised that the time was not yet propitious.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
